{"conversations": [{"role": "user", "content": "帮我做一个国际协作诗歌大赛的数字票务邀请页面。活动将在西班牙马德里的皇家剧院（Teatro Real）举办，是一场汇聚多国诗人的高规格文学盛事。页面需要展示活动的标题首屏、日期与场馆信息、活动描述段落、三档票价对比（Early Bird / General / VIP）、评奖标准可视化、三个奖项介绍，以及注册报名的 CTA 按钮和页脚联系信息。整体风格要有文学气质和仪式感，不要做成普通的电商购票页——打开就得让人觉得这是一封高雅的邀请函。技术上用单文件 HTML + Tailwind CDN 就好，不需要框架。"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<think>\n让我先把这个需求在脑子里转一圈，想清楚它的本质。这是一个活动的票务页，但不只是功能性的购票表单——它同时是一封邀请函，一张海报，甚至某种程度上是一件文化宣传物。活动名字叫\"International Collaborative Poetry Slam\"，在西班牙马德里的皇家剧院（Teatro Real）举办。Teatro Real是世界级的文化地标，这个场地选择本身就在传递信号：这是一场有分量的活动，不是普通的文艺沙龙。\n\n那用户是谁？打开这个页面的人大概分三类：第一类是文学爱好者和诗歌从业者，25到50岁，文艺圈子里的人，他们有审美要求，对活动气质很敏感；第二类是企业赞助代表和媒体记者，他们关注的是活动的专业度和公信力；第三类是通过朋友链接偶然进来的泛文艺受众，这类人是潜在的转化人群，需要靠页面本身的气质说服他们。核心用户行为路径是：打开页面 → 30秒内判断\"值不值得去\" → 看价格 → 点报名。所以信息优先级非常清晰：情绪先行，信息其次，行动兜底。\n\n嗯，有一个感受我需要牢牢抓住——这个页面更像一张邀请函，而不是一张购物车。邀请函的逻辑是：先让人觉得\"我被邀请了，这个活动很特别\"，再让人去找票价和日期；而不是一上来就把票价表推到脸上。这一点会深刻影响视觉设计的节奏。\n\n页面结构大概可以这样想：首屏 Hero 区建立情绪（活动名称 + 日期地点 + 情绪标语），往下是时间地点的快速确认，然后活动描述深化参与意愿，接着票价表帮助完成决策，CTA 按钮兜底转化，后半段是评奖标准和奖项信息给参赛者看，最后页脚是联系信息和品牌背书。这是文化活动页的标准骨架，内容层级本身没什么争议，视觉风格的选择才是真正的差异化战场。\n\n好，来想视觉方向。脑子里先冒出三个思路，逐一过一遍。\n\n第一个方向：传统印刷邀请函的数字化版本。做法是奶油白底色、黑色衬线字体、边框装饰线、经典的版式比例。这个方向非常克制，优雅，给人一种翻开精装诗集扉页的感觉。优点是几乎不会犯错，适合偏学术气质的文学活动。问题是——它太安静了，太被动了，缺少活动页应有的那种期待感和张力。用户看了这个页面，脑子里浮现的是图书馆、书展，而不是\"今晚我要去那里\"的冲动。更关键的是，这种风格在同类文化活动页里已经非常多见，白底衬线体排版几乎是同质化的代名词，做出来很难被记住。这个方向放一边。\n\n第二个方向：深色氛围感——暗底搭配霓虹文字粒子和打字机效果，用 scroll-driven 的场景切换来讲故事。这个思路有点诱人——想象一下黑色背景上金色的发光文字逐渐显现，很有\"深夜、舞台灯光、朗诵开始\"的那种沉浸感。但等等，仔细想想，这个活动是在皇家剧院举办的\"国际精英文学活动\"，它的气质关键词是\"文化底蕴、仪式感、温暖庄重、高雅\"。暗色 + 霓虹 + 滚动视差这套组合，在情绪上更接近实验艺术节、先锋音乐节或者地下 club 的海报，跟这次活动的\"被邀请的仪式感\"存在明显的情绪错位。而且实现上，如果要做 GSAP 驱动的场景切换加文字粒子系统，在单文件 HTML + 原生 JS 的约束下很容易失控，代码量会暴增，调试成本高。这个方向的问题是根本性的——不是技术问题，是气质匹配问题。放弃。\n\n第三个方向：文学编辑风，暖米色纸感底色，配深酒红作为主色，Playfair Display 的大衬线标题，加一层 Canvas 水墨粒子背景。这个思路有意思——暖米色（接近 #F5EDD8）让人联想到年代久远的纸张、旧书页、精装诗集的扉页，这种质感在数字端并不常见；酒红（#8B1A2E）作为主色和强调色，有一种欧洲古典印刷书籍的庄重感，比黑色更有温度；水墨粒子动效用极低透明度慢速漂移，只是一种空间感的暗示，不抢内容的风头。这三个元素组合起来：纸张感 × 水墨动效 × 衬线排版，形成了一套差异化的视觉语言，在同类文学活动页里比较少见。再加上虚线边框的票面包裹——模拟真实票根的撕口切角——会给用户一种\"我手里正拿着一张票\"的具身感，跟\"邀请函\"的叙事逻辑高度契合。\n\n好，方向三基本确定了。但在细化之前，有几个具体问题我必须想清楚。\n\n首先是色彩系统。暖米色 #F5EDD8 作为页面底色；稍浅一点的奶白 #FDF8EE 作为卡片背景；深酒红 #8B1A2E 作为主色——用于区块标题、CTA 按钮、表格表头；金铜色 #C49A44 作为强调色——用于 VIP 行高亮、装饰线、进度条渐变端点；近黑 #1E1A14 作为正文色；中性暖棕 #6B5D4A 作为次级文字；边框和分隔线用暖米 #D4C4A0；页脚用深色 #1E1A14 背景收尾，营造文学书籍封底的感觉。这套色彩系统的逻辑是统一的：暖调、克制、文学感，没有任何冷色跑进来。\n\n等等，刚才我下意识想在卡片背景上加玻璃拟态（backdrop-filter blur），这是个坏主意——在暖米色背景上用 glassmorphism 会破坏纸张质感，而且设计上有明文禁止。坚决不用玻璃拟态，卡片就用奶白色固体背景 + 细边框 + 轻阴影就好，更符合纸张叠放的感觉。\n\n字体系统这块至关重要，它是这个页面气质的脊梁。标题层级用 Playfair Display 700——它有19世纪欧洲印刷体的优雅感，特别是 700 字重的直立版本有很强的分量感，斜体变体则有诗句排版特有的流动感。正文用 Lora，同属衬线系但专为屏幕可读性优化，行高1.75能让段落有充足的呼吸感。辅助标签、表头说明这类元素用系统无衬线字体就够了，不需要额外加载字重，保持轻量。这套字体组合在情感上是统一的：文学传统、温暖、可信赖。\n\n关于 Canvas 水墨粒子，有一个很容易犯错的地方：透明度绝对不能调高。粒子的颜色是极低透明度的酒红（rgba(139,26,46,0.045)）和金铜（rgba(196,154,68,0.055)），视觉上几乎察觉不到具体形状，只是空间里有\"什么\"在缓慢移动的感觉——就像印刷纸张里纸浆的微细纹路。粒子用正弦叠加的伪噪声场驱动方向，半径在30到80px之间，每帧用极低透明度的 fillRect 覆盖而不是 clearRect，制造拖尾效果。Canvas 层只覆盖 Hero 首屏，z-index 为0，内容层为1，两者不混淆。另外，若用户系统开启了 prefers-reduced-motion，直接跳过 Canvas 初始化，优雅降级。\n\n让我仔细想想票价表格这块。三档：Early Bird €15、General €25、VIP €50。表格的核心任务是帮助用户在5秒内完成定价判断，所以视觉层级要清晰。表头用酒红背景白字，建立权威感；奇偶行交替底纹（白卡与 #F0E8D4 交替），增加可扫描性；VIP 行用金铜色左侧3px实线高亮——这是一种非常经典的\"编辑推荐\"视觉语言，低调而有效；价格数字用 Playfair Display 字体放大展示，让用户视线第一时间落在价格上；hover 行用金铜色的极低透明度叠加，跟整体色系保持统一。\n\n评奖标准用进度条可视化是一个很好的决定。五个维度（Performance 30分 / Originality 20分 / Collaboration 20分 / Language Usage 20分 / Audience Engagement 10分），水平进度条宽度按分值比例确定。进度条颜色用酒红到金铜的渐变，从主色走向强调色，这条渐变可以贯穿整个页面作为视觉母题。关键是要用 Intersection Observer 触发宽度从0到目标值的动画，stagger 依次触发，120ms 间隔，给人一种\"评分维度正在被宣布\"的节奏感。\n\n啊对了，奖项卡片这块——三列布局，1/2/3等，第一名有金铜色双线边框强调。要注意不能做得太重，三张卡片的底色相同，差异只在边框粗细和颜色，保持克制。hover 上浮 translateY(-6px) 加深阴影，把互动反馈留给用户主动触碰。\n\n滚动入场动画全局用 Intersection Observer + CSS transition 实现。所有 `.reveal` 元素初始状态 opacity 0 + translateY 28px，进入视口时切换为 visible。Hero 区的元素用 inline `transition-delay` 做 stagger——eyebrow 标语 0.1s、主标题 0.25s、副标题 0.4s、CTA 0.55s、向下箭头 0.7s，整体节奏像幕布徐徐拉开。注意不要给所有元素相同的动画时长，Hero 元素用 0.7s，普通 section 入场也用 0.7s，进度条专门用 0.9s，稍慢一点让变化更清晰。\n\n关键来了，页面最值得打磨的三个交互细节：第一是 Hero 各元素的 stagger 淡入——用户打开页面时，eyebrow 先出现，然后大标题从下方浮起，再到副标题，最后是 CTA，整个过程大概1.5秒，像舞台幕布缓缓揭开；第二是评奖进度条的 stagger 增长动画——数字维度的信息以动态方式呈现，让这块内容有节奏和美感；第三是 VIP 行的视觉强调——金铜色左边框 + 金铜色价格数字 + 金铜色 VIP 标签徽章，帮助视线快速在定价区落点。\n\n技术适配一句话：单文件 HTML + Tailwind CDN + 原生 Canvas 2D，完全不依赖构建工具，Tailwind 的 JIT 模式覆盖所有定制颜色和字体配置，Canvas 粒子系统只需原生 JS 约200行就能搞定，轻量可靠。\n</think>\n\n好的，我来为你实现这个国际协作诗歌大赛的数字票务邀请页面。\n\n```html\n<!-- poetry-slam-ticket@v5_20260402/03_frontend/index.html -->\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>International Collaborative Poetry Slam — October 21, 2023</title>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&family=Lora:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\" />\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  <script>\n    tailwind.config = {\n      theme: {\n        extend: {\n          colors: {\n            'bg-base': '#F5EDD8',\n            'bg-card': '#FDF8EE',\n            'primary': '#8B1A2E',\n            'primary-hover': '#6B1222',\n            'accent': '#C49A44',\n            'text-main': '#1E1A14',\n            'text-muted': '#6B5D4A',\n            'border-base': '#D4C4A0',\n            'table-stripe': '#F0E8D4',\n            'bg-footer': '#1E1A14',\n            'text-footer': '#B0A080',\n          },\n          fontFamily: {\n            'display': ['\"Playfair Display\"', 'Georgia', 'serif'],\n            'body': ['Lora', 'Georgia', 'serif'],\n          },\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  </script>\n  <style>\n    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }\n    body { background-color: #F5EDD8; font-family: 'Lora', Georgia, serif; color: #1E1A14; }\n\n    /* Canvas Hero Layer */\n    #ink-canvas {\n      position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\n      pointer-events: none; z-index: 0;\n    }\n    #hero { position: relative; overflow: hidden; }\n    .hero-content { position: relative; z-index: 1; }\n\n    /* Fade-in animation */\n    .reveal {\n      opacity: 0;\n      transform: translateY(28px);\n      transition: opacity 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.25,0.46,0.45,0.94),\n                  transform 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.25,0.46,0.45,0.94);\n    }\n    .reveal.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n\n    /* First letter drop cap */\n    .dropcap::first-letter {\n      font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;\n      font-size: 4.5rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #8B1A2E;\n      float: left;\n      line-height: 0.72;\n      margin-right: 0.12em;\n      margin-top: 0.08em;\n    }\n\n    /* Decorative divider */\n    .ornament { text-align: center; color: #C49A44; letter-spacing: 0.5em; font-size: 1rem; }\n\n    /* Table hover */\n    .ticket-table tbody tr { transition: background 0.2s ease; cursor: default; }\n    .ticket-table tbody tr:hover { background: rgba(196,154,68,0.13) !important; }\n\n    /* VIP row accent */\n    .vip-row { border-left: 3px solid #C49A44; }\n\n    /* Progress bar */\n    .bar-track { background: #D4C4A0; border-radius: 9999px; overflow: hidden; }\n    .bar-fill {\n      height: 100%;\n      border-radius: 9999px;\n      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #8B1A2E, #C49A44);\n      width: 0%;\n      transition: width 0.9s cubic-bezier(0.25,0.46,0.45,0.94);\n    }\n\n    /* CTA Button */\n    .btn-cta {\n      display: inline-block;\n      background: #8B1A2E;\n      color: #FDF8EE;\n      font-family: 'Lora', Georgia, serif;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n      padding: 18px 56px;\n      border-radius: 9999px;\n      text-decoration: none;\n      box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(139,26,46,0.32);\n      transition: background 0.25s, transform 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.34,1.56,0.64,1), box-shadow 0.25s;\n    }\n    .btn-cta:hover {\n      background: #6B1222;\n      transform: scale(1.04);\n      box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(139,26,46,0.40);\n    }\n    .btn-cta:active { transform: scale(0.97); }\n    .btn-cta:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #C49A44; outline-offset: 4px; }\n\n    /* Prize cards */\n    .prize-card {\n      transition: transform 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.25,0.46,0.45,0.94),\n                  box-shadow 0.25s ease;\n    }\n    .prize-card:hover {\n      transform: translateY(-6px);\n      box-shadow: 0 14px 40px rgba(30,26,20,0.18);\n    }\n\n    /* Info cards */\n    .info-card {\n      transition: transform 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;\n    }\n    .info-card:hover {\n      transform: translateY(-4px);\n      box-shadow: 0 10px 32px rgba(30,26,20,0.16);\n    }\n\n    /* Ticket dashed border */\n    .ticket-wrapper {\n      border: 2px dashed #D4C4A0;\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n    .ticket-wrapper::before,\n    .ticket-wrapper::after {\n      content: '';\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 50%;\n      width: 24px; height: 24px;\n      background: #F5EDD8;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      border: 2px dashed #D4C4A0;\n      transform: translateY(-50%);\n    }\n    .ticket-wrapper::before { left: -13px; }\n    .ticket-wrapper::after { right: -13px; }\n\n    /* SVG decorative line */\n    .svg-rule { display: block; margin: 0 auto; }\n\n    /* Scroll down indicator */\n    @keyframes bounce {\n      0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }\n      50% { transform: translateY(8px); }\n    }\n    .bounce-arrow { animation: bounce 1.8s ease-in-out infinite; }\n\n    /* Footer link hover */\n    .footer-link { transition: color 0.2s; }\n    .footer-link:hover { color: #C49A44; }\n\n    @media (max-width: 768px) {\n      .dropcap::first-letter { font-size: 3rem; }\n      .ticket-wrapper::before, .ticket-wrapper::after { display: none; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"min-h-screen\">\n\n  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════\n       HERO\n  ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->\n  <section id=\"hero\" class=\"min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-6 py-24 bg-bg-base text-center\">\n    <canvas id=\"ink-canvas\"></canvas>\n    <div class=\"hero-content max-w-3xl mx-auto\">\n      <!-- Eyebrow -->\n      <p class=\"reveal ornament mb-6 tracking-widest text-sm font-body uppercase\" style=\"transition-delay:0.1s\">\n        ✦ &nbsp; October 21, 2023 &nbsp;·&nbsp; Madrid, Spain &nbsp; ✦\n      </p>\n\n      <!-- Main Title -->\n      <h1 class=\"reveal font-display text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-text-main leading-tight mb-4\" style=\"transition-delay:0.25s\">\n        International<br/>\n        <em class=\"text-primary not-italic\">Collaborative</em><br/>\n        Poetry Slam\n      </h1>\n\n      <!-- Sub-headline -->\n      <p class=\"reveal font-body italic text-text-muted text-lg md:text-xl mb-10 leading-relaxed\" style=\"transition-delay:0.4s\">\n        An evening of global voices, creative collaboration,<br class=\"hidden md:inline\"/> and the art of the spoken word.\n      </p>\n\n      <!-- CTA -->\n      <div class=\"reveal\" style=\"transition-delay:0.55s\">\n        <a href=\"https://internationalpoetryslam.eventbrite.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"btn-cta text-base md:text-lg\">\n          Register Now\n        </a>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Scroll down arrow -->\n      <div class=\"reveal mt-16 bounce-arrow text-border-base\" style=\"transition-delay:0.7s\">\n        <svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 28 28\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n          <path d=\"M14 4v20M6 16l8 8 8-8\" stroke=\"#D4C4A0\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════\n       MAIN TICKET CONTENT\n  ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->\n  <main class=\"px-6 py-16 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">\n\n    <!-- Ticket wrapper -->\n    <div class=\"ticket-wrapper bg-bg-card p-8 md:p-12 shadow-md mb-16\">\n\n      <!-- Ornamental header -->\n      <div class=\"reveal ornament mb-8\">\n        ❧ &nbsp; YOUR INVITATION &nbsp; ❧\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- ── Date & Venue ── -->\n      <div class=\"reveal grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-12\">\n        <!-- Date & Time -->\n        <div class=\"info-card bg-bg-base rounded-lg p-6 border border-border-base shadow-sm text-center\">\n          <div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🕕</div>\n          <h2 class=\"font-display text-primary text-lg font-bold mb-2 tracking-wide uppercase text-sm\">Date &amp; Time</h2>\n          <p class=\"font-display text-text-main text-xl font-bold mb-1\">October 21, 2023</p>\n          <p class=\"font-body text-text-muted italic\">6:00 PM — 9:00 PM</p>\n        </div>\n        <!-- Venue -->\n        <div class=\"info-card bg-bg-base rounded-lg p-6 border border-border-base shadow-sm text-center\">\n          <div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">📍</div>\n          <h2 class=\"font-display text-primary text-lg font-bold mb-2 tracking-wide uppercase text-sm\">Venue</h2>\n          <p class=\"font-display text-text-main text-xl font-bold mb-1\">Teatro Real</p>\n          <p class=\"font-body text-text-muted italic\">Madrid, Spain</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- SVG ornamental divider -->\n      <div class=\"reveal ornament text-border-base mb-10\">\n        <svg class=\"svg-rule\" width=\"240\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 240 18\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n          <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"95\" y2=\"9\" stroke=\"#D4C4A0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n          <path d=\"M112 9 C115 3, 120 1, 120 9 C120 17, 125 15, 128 9\" stroke=\"#C49A44\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" fill=\"none\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"9\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#C49A44\"/>\n          <line x1=\"145\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"9\" stroke=\"#D4C4A0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- ── Description ── -->\n      <div class=\"reveal mb-12\">\n        <h2 class=\"font-display text-primary text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-center\">About the Event</h2>\n        <p class=\"dropcap font-body text-text-main leading-relaxed text-base md:text-lg\">\n          Join us for an evening of collaborative creativity at the International Collaborative Poetry Slam. Teams of poets from around the world will come together to craft and perform original works. Spectators can expect a night of riveting performances, artistic expression, and community spirit.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- SVG ornamental divider -->\n      <div class=\"reveal ornament text-border-base mb-10\">\n        <svg class=\"svg-rule\" width=\"240\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 240 18\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n          <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"95\" y2=\"9\" stroke=\"#D4C4A0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n          <polygon points=\"120,3 127,15 113,15\" fill=\"#C49A44\" opacity=\"0.7\"/>\n          <line x1=\"145\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"9\" stroke=\"#D4C4A0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- ── Ticket Pricing ── -->\n      <div class=\"reveal mb-12\">\n        <h2 class=\"font-display text-primary text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-center\">Ticket Pricing</h2>\n        <div class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-border-base shadow-sm\">\n          <table class=\"ticket-table w-full font-body text-sm md:text-base\">\n            <thead>\n              <tr class=\"bg-primary text-bg-card text-center\">\n                <th class=\"py-4 px-6 font-display text-left font-bold tracking-wide\">Ticket Type</th>\n                <th class=\"py-4 px-6 font-display font-bold tracking-wide\">Price</th>\n                <th class=\"py-4 px-6 font-display font-bold tracking-wide text-right\">Details</th>\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n              <tr class=\"border-t border-border-base bg-bg-card text-center\">\n                <td class=\"py-4 px-6 text-left\">\n                  <span class=\"font-body font-semibold text-text-main\">Early Bird</span>\n                </td>\n                <td class=\"py-4 px-6 font-display font-bold text-primary text-xl\">€15</td>\n                <td class=\"py-4 px-6 text-right text-text-muted italic text-sm\">Limited availability</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr class=\"border-t border-border-base bg-table-stripe text-center\">\n                <td class=\"py-4 px-6 text-left\">\n                  <span class=\"font-body font-semibold text-text-main\">General Admission</span>\n                </td>\n                <td class=\"py-4 px-6 font-display font-bold text-primary text-xl\">€25</td>\n                <td class=\"py-4 px-6 text-right text-text-muted italic text-sm\">Full event access</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr class=\"border-t border-border-base bg-bg-card text-center vip-row\">\n                <td class=\"py-4 px-6 text-left\">\n                  <span class=\"font-body font-semibold text-text-main\">VIP</span>\n                  <span class=\"ml-2 text-xs bg-accent text-bg-card px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-semibold tracking-wide\">✦ VIP</span>\n                </td>\n                <td class=\"py-4 px-6 font-display font-bold text-accent text-xl\">€50</td>\n                <td class=\"py-4 px-6 text-right text-text-muted italic text-sm\">Priority seating + reception</td>\n              </tr>\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- ── CTA ── -->\n      <div class=\"reveal text-center mb-4\">\n        <p class=\"font-body italic text-text-muted mb-6 text-base\">Secure your seat at this extraordinary celebration of world poetry.</p>\n        <a href=\"https://internationalpoetryslam.eventbrite.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"btn-cta text-base md:text-lg\">\n          Register on Eventbrite →\n        </a>\n      </div>\n\n    </div><!-- /ticket-wrapper -->\n\n    <!-- ── Judging Criteria ── -->\n    <section class=\"reveal mb-16\">\n      <h2 class=\"font-display text-primary text-2xl font-bold mb-8 text-center\">Judging Criteria</h2>\n      <div class=\"bg-bg-card border border-border-base rounded-lg p-6 md:p-10 shadow-sm\">\n        <div class=\"space-y-6\" id=\"criteria-bars\">\n          <!-- dynamically rendered via JS -->\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ── Prizes ── -->\n    <section class=\"reveal mb-16\">\n      <h2 class=\"font-display text-primary text-2xl font-bold mb-8 text-center\">Prizes</h2>\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n        <!-- 1st -->\n        <div class=\"prize-card bg-bg-card border-2 border-accent rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm text-center\">\n          <div class=\"text-4xl mb-3\">🥇</div>\n          <h3 class=\"font-display text-accent text-xl font-bold mb-1\">1st Place</h3>\n          <p class=\"font-display text-text-main text-2xl font-bold mb-3\">€500</p>\n          <p class=\"font-body text-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed italic\">Publishing contract with Editorial Anagrama</p>\n        </div>\n        <!-- 2nd -->\n        <div class=\"prize-card bg-bg-card border border-border-base rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm text-center\">\n          <div class=\"text-4xl mb-3\">🥈</div>\n          <h3 class=\"font-display text-text-main text-xl font-bold mb-1\">2nd Place</h3>\n          <p class=\"font-display text-text-main text-2xl font-bold mb-3\">€300</p>\n          <p class=\"font-body text-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed italic\">Feature in Poesía Digital magazine</p>\n        </div>\n        <!-- 3rd -->\n        <div class=\"prize-card bg-bg-card border border-border-base rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm text-center\">\n          <div class=\"text-4xl mb-3\">🥉</div>\n          <h3 class=\"font-display text-text-main text-xl font-bold mb-1\">3rd Place</h3>\n          <p class=\"font-display text-text-main text-2xl font-bold mb-3\">€150</p>\n          <p class=\"font-body text-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed italic\">Workshop with renowned poet Ben Clark</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════\n       FOOTER\n  ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->\n  <footer class=\"bg-bg-footer text-text-footer px-6 py-14\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto\">\n      <!-- Divider ornament -->\n      <div class=\"text-center mb-10 opacity-50\">\n        <svg class=\"svg-rule\" width=\"180\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 14\" fill=\"none\">\n          <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"7\" x2=\"72\" y2=\"7\" stroke=\"#B0A080\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#C49A44\" opacity=\"0.7\"/>\n          <line x1=\"108\" y1=\"7\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"7\" stroke=\"#B0A080\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 mb-10\">\n        <!-- Contact -->\n        <div>\n          <h3 class=\"font-display text-bg-card text-base font-bold mb-4 tracking-widest uppercase text-sm\">Contact</h3>\n          <ul class=\"space-y-2 font-body text-sm\">\n            <li>\n              <a href=\"mailto:info@internationalpoetryslam.com\" class=\"footer-link\">\n                ✉ &nbsp;info@internationalpoetryslam.com\n              </a>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <a href=\"tel:+34911234567\" class=\"footer-link\">\n                ☎ &nbsp;+34 91 123 4567\n              </a>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n        <!-- Sponsors -->\n        <div>\n          <h3 class=\"font-display text-bg-card text-base font-bold mb-4 tracking-widest uppercase text-sm\">Proudly Sponsored By</h3>\n          <ul class=\"space-y-2 font-body text-sm\">\n            <li class=\"footer-link cursor-default\">Editorial Anagrama</li>\n            <li class=\"footer-link cursor-default\">Poesía Digital</li>\n            <li class=\"footer-link cursor-default\">Fundación Loewe</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"text-center text-xs opacity-40 font-body\">\n        © 2023 International Collaborative Poetry Slam · Teatro Real, Madrid, Spain\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════\n       JAVASCRIPT\n  ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->\n  <script>\n    /* ─── Judging Criteria Data ─── */\n    const criteria = [\n      { label: 'Performance',        points: 30, max: 100 },\n      { label: 'Originality',        points: 20, max: 100 },\n      { label: 'Collaboration',      points: 20, max: 100 },\n      { label: 'Language Usage',     points: 20, max: 100 },\n      { label: 'Audience Engagement',points: 10, max: 100 },\n    ];\n\n    function renderCriteria() {\n      const container = document.getElementById('criteria-bars');\n      criteria.forEach((c, i) => {\n        const row = document.createElement('div');\n        row.dataset.points = c.points;\n        row.innerHTML = `\n          <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center mb-1\">\n            <span class=\"font-body text-text-main font-semibold text-sm md:text-base\">${c.label}</span>\n            <span class=\"font-display text-primary font-bold text-sm\">${c.points} pts</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bar-track h-2.5\">\n            <div class=\"bar-fill\" data-width=\"${c.points}%\"></div>\n          </div>`;\n        container.appendChild(row);\n      });\n    }\n\n    /* ─── Intersection Observer: reveal + bar animate ─── */\n    function setupReveal() {\n      const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n        entries.forEach(entry => {\n          if (entry.isIntersecting) {\n            entry.target.classList.add('visible');\n            observer.unobserve(entry.target);\n          }\n        });\n      }, { threshold: 0.15 });\n\n      document.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach(el => observer.observe(el));\n    }\n\n    function setupBars() {\n      const barObserver = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n        entries.forEach(entry => {\n          if (entry.isIntersecting) {\n            const fills = entry.target.querySelectorAll('.bar-fill');\n            fills.forEach((fill, i) => {\n              setTimeout(() => {\n                fill.style.width = fill.dataset.width;\n              }, i * 120);\n            });\n            barObserver.unobserve(entry.target);\n          }\n        });\n      }, { threshold: 0.3 });\n\n      const barsSection = document.getElementById('criteria-bars');\n      if (barsSection) barObserver.observe(barsSection);\n    }\n\n    /* ─── Canvas Ink Particle System ─── */\n    function initInkCanvas() {\n      if (window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches) return;\n\n      const canvas = document.getElementById('ink-canvas');\n      const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n      let W, H, particles;\n\n      function resize() {\n        W = canvas.width  = canvas.offsetWidth;\n        H = canvas.height = canvas.offsetHeight;\n      }\n\n      // Simple pseudo-noise using sine compositing\n      function noise(x, y, t) {\n        return Math.sin(x * 0.007 + t * 0.4)\n             * Math.cos(y * 0.009 + t * 0.3)\n             + Math.sin((x + y) * 0.006 + t * 0.2);\n      }\n\n      function createParticles() {\n        particles = Array.from({ length: 70 }, () => ({\n          x: Math.random() * W,\n          y: Math.random() * H,\n          r: 30 + Math.random() * 55,\n          speed: 0.18 + Math.random() * 0.32,\n          phase: Math.random() * Math.PI * 2,\n          colorType: Math.random() > 0.5 ? 0 : 1,\n        }));\n      }\n\n      let t = 0;\n      function draw() {\n        // Very faint fade-over creates trailing effect\n        ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(245, 237, 216, 0.08)';\n        ctx.fillRect(0, 0, W, H);\n\n        particles.forEach(p => {\n          const angle = noise(p.x, p.y, t + p.phase) * Math.PI * 2;\n          p.x += Math.cos(angle) * p.speed;\n          p.y += Math.sin(angle) * p.speed;\n          // Wrap\n          if (p.x < -p.r) p.x = W + p.r;\n          if (p.x > W + p.r) p.x = -p.r;\n          if (p.y < -p.r) p.y = H + p.r;\n          if (p.y > H + p.r) p.y = -p.r;\n\n          ctx.save();\n          ctx.filter = 'blur(18px)';\n          const alpha = p.colorType === 0 ? 0.045 : 0.055;\n          const color = p.colorType === 0\n            ? `rgba(139, 26, 46, ${alpha})`\n            : `rgba(196, 154, 68, ${alpha})`;\n          ctx.beginPath();\n          ctx.arc(p.x, p.y, p.r, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n          ctx.fillStyle = color;\n          ctx.fill();\n          ctx.restore();\n        });\n\n        t += 0.003;\n        requestAnimationFrame(draw);\n      }\n\n      resize();\n      createParticles();\n      draw();\n      window.addEventListener('resize', () => { resize(); createParticles(); });\n    }\n\n    /* ─── Hero reveal on load ─── */\n    function heroReveal() {\n      const hero = document.querySelectorAll('#hero .reveal');\n      hero.forEach(el => {\n        setTimeout(() => el.classList.add('visible'), parseInt(el.style.transitionDelay || '0') * 1000 + 200);\n      });\n    }\n\n    /* ─── Init ─── */\n    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n      renderCriteria();\n      setupReveal();\n      setupBars();\n      initInkCanvas();\n      // Hero elements: trigger with delay from inline style\n      document.querySelectorAll('#hero .reveal').forEach(el => {\n        const delay = parseFloat(el.style.transitionDelay || 0) * 1000;\n        setTimeout(() => el.classList.add('visible'), delay + 100);\n      });\n    });\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n\n```"}], "metadata": {"case_id": "poetry-slam-ticket@v5_20260402", "domain": "cultural-event / literary-arts", "pipeline_version": "v5", "source_case": "outputs/poetry-slam-ticket@v5_20260402", "synth_method": "long-chain-design-v1", "token_estimate": 28000, "stage_files_used": ["meta.json", "01_pm/prd.md", "02_designer/design_brief.md", "03_frontend/index.html"]}}
